            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.0.4</h2>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Improved microphone reliability when switching devices or reconnecting a preferred microphone during app-audio recording.</li>
  <li>Recordings that start without capturing audio are now retried automatically, and you’re notified if recording still cannot begin.</li>
</ul>
